    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but i'm not looking for a lecture on risk tolerance. i'm looking for what your models are actually seeing. if things look like they are going to dip significantly in the next few months, i need to know now. i'd rather be safe than sorry. is there any reason i shouldn't be worried about a drop in the next quarter?",
