      "content": "My models process vast amounts of data, but they do not predict specific, guaranteed market downturns, only potential probabilities. It is true that high interest rates and economic uncertainty are creating market caution, which can lead to short-term pullbacks in any portfolio.\n\nHowever, a \"significant drop\" is highly uncertain, and a move to cash can also create an \"opportunity cost\" for future gains. If the goal is absolute safety, a high-yield savings account is a secure choice, but that path will sacrifice potential market upside.",
